  "limitations": [
    "Direct denotes relatively close operational wording, not equivalence or independent validation. Proxy denotes a behavior/ability or context conversion needing confirmation. Both are fixed prior to candidate computation, after reference exposure. Unmapped descriptions and absence of a combination are not negative evidence.",
    "All named combinations catalogued; no predictions of disease, identity, criminality, hereditary status, partners or mortality. Historical occupation/status descriptions are not automatic behavior predicates.",
    "Same sidereal sign and circular degree thresholds are modern sensitivity conventions, not uniquely authorized ancient conjunction conditions. Exact isolated groups exclude larger or nonclique linked groups; inclusive alternatives permit subsets.",
    "No Rahu/Ketu, four-plus chapter, strength, aspect, divisional or dasha outcome is implemented in this bounded family. No school selection from rank."
  ]
}
